SUMMARY:How Can We Support the New Generation of Women Mediators for Peace?
DESCRIPTION:At a time when security\, geopolitical\, social\, and environmental crises are becoming increasingly complex\, renewing both the faces and the approaches of peacebuilding has become imperative. This conference highlights a major strategic challenge: the need to train\, fund\, and empower a new generation of mediators.\nhttps://www.sciencespo.fr/fr/evenements/how-can-we-support-the-new-generation-of-women-mediators-for-peace/
LOCATION:Sciences Po\, 27 rue Saint-Guillaume\, Paris 7e
